   "kind": "test-defect",
   "sev": "med",
   "text": "setUp and tearDown call PendingEncryptionLedger.clearAll(), which empties the REAL ledger in the app host's standard UserDefaults (keys storage.pendingReencryption.sessionIDs/rawBackupIDs). Running the suite on a device or simulator whose app container holds sessions written without encryption erases their repair records, so reencryptPendingSessions never re-encrypts those files and they stay as plaintext health data.",
